				"widget_ue_connectable":{
					
				},
				"Node name for S&R":"CreateVideo"
			},
			"order":23
		},
		{
			"outputs":[
				
			],
			"color":"#222",
			"widgets_values":[
				"\nThis template runs the **Image to Video** task (`MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo` node) with the [FastVideo FastH3 8-Step V2](https://huggingface.co/FastVideo/FastVideo-FastH3-8-Step-V2) checkpoint, a DMD2-distilled model that generates synchronized video and audio in **8 sampling steps** instead of the base model's full schedule. It covers both:\n\n- **t2va** (text-to-video), when no images are connected\n- **fl2va** (first/last-frame image-to-video), when `first_frame` and/or `last_frame` are connected\n\n**Checkpoint repo**: [FastVideo/FastVideo-FastH3-Comfy](https://huggingface.co/FastVideo/FastVideo-FastH3-Comfy)\n\n**Scope**: this distilled checkpoint supports t2va and fl2va only. Ref2VA (multi-reference conditioning) was not distilled; use the base MiniMax H3 model for reference-based tasks.\n\n**Key inputs**\n\n- **first_frame / last_frame**: optional keyframes; the model generates the motion between them\n- **prompt**: describe the shots, motion, and the accompanying audio (dialogue, SFX, music) in one block\n- **width / height**: set via Resolution Selector. H3's native canvas is a 768px short edge, capped at 768x1344 pixels, rounded to a multiple of 32\n- **duration (seconds)**: converted to a valid frame `length` by the Math Expression node, snapping up to the model's 17-frame-per-block (17k+5) grid at 24fps\n"
			],
			"inputs":[
				
			],
			"flags":{
				
			},
			"type":"MarkdownNote",
			"title":"Note: Fast Video FastH3",
			"mode":0,
			"bgcolor":"#000",
			"size":[
				450,
				630
			],
			"pos":[
				-1730,
				4880
			],
